{"4268060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Piano Trauma - Stress Deluxe", "steam_appid": 4268060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Just Updated</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CO - OP mode available!</strong><br>We have added an option to play with your friend! <br>You can play the demo together right now!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOU HAVE A CONCERT TO PLAY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your friend need to leave your home and get to the concert hall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get your piano and travel through the bizarre world to play a life-changing performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268060/extras/39d613b7ce6c0e22f7a045f3f7ed8223.poster.avif?t=1783432844\" width=1170 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268060/extras/39d613b7ce6c0e22f7a045f3f7ed8223.webm?t=1783432844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268060/extras/39d613b7ce6c0e22f7a045f3f7ed8223.mp4?t=1783432844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THIS JOURNEY WON'T BE EASY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome obstacles with jumps across rooftops, chasms, gaps, and other obstructions - because overshooting hurts just as much as coming up short.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Responsive and precise controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nitro that amplifies every move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delightful classical music to accompany your agonizing failures</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268060/extras/aafbc987e71beabe108c696e329a7eab.poster.avif?t=1783432844\" width=1170 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268060/extras/aafbc987e71beabe108c696e329a7eab.webm?t=1783432844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268060/extras/aafbc987e71beabe108c696e329a7eab.mp4?t=1783432844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Piano Trauma - Stress Deluxe, you can experience:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>P</strong>rodigious piano player</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>T</strong>remendous power of extinguishers</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>S</strong>tressing the limits of the human mind</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>D</strong>elightful classical music</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist now, and get notified when the game releases<strong>!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268060/extras/ff857f442512c936f499ea160bd899c8.poster.avif?t=1783432844\" width=1170 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268060/extras/ff857f442512c936f499ea160bd899c8.webm?t=1783432844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4268060/extras/ff857f442512c936f4